  "created": "2026-08-11T14:45:49.223Z",
  "description": "A Result pattern (Result / Result<T>) that runs anywhere .NET does: one .NET Standard 2.0 assembly, verified on .NET Framework 4.8 and .NET 9, referenceable from .NET Framework 4.6.1+, .NET Core 2.0+, .NET 5-9+, Unity, Xamarin and MAUI. Zero dependencies and zero reflection, so it is trim- and Native AOT-safe and adds nothing to your dependency graph. Structured errors with stable codes, validation batching, ErrorType-to-HTTP-status mapping and pagination. Allocation-conscious: the success path measures 0 bytes per operation, and Result is a 24-byte struct.",
